<title>USA: Key IMM currency futures start lower.</title>
<headline>Key IMM currency futures start lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 17 - Key IMM currency futures started lower as dollar strength continued. Sept marks down slightly, despite intervention talk. Sept sterling slid to a 2-week low on more profit-taking. Yen also slightly lower after overnight news June Japanese trade surplus widened less than forecast.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
<p>E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com</p>
